WEBVTT

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:08.234
Today is the day when

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:15.534
the Virgin Gauri sat down to worship Shiva.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:23.534
She made a Shiva Lingua and was
sitting and putting Her “sindur” on that:

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:30.254
“That you look after this, which is the mark of my union with you.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:35.701
I leave it to you, to look after.”- to Shiva. “You look after this.

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:40.120
I surrender to you for this.”

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.920
That’s how the Gauri, your Kundalini, surrenders to the Spirit:

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.767
“Now, You look after this connection. I forget
everything else. I leave it into your hands. Lift me up.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:01:00.953
You raise me up. I forget all that was
me before. Everything I have dropped out.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:06.254
No other desire. But just lift me higher and higher.

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:10.120
Make me yourself. The rest of it is not important.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.487
All other manifestations of these desires are over.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:17.621
Now, I am absolutely surrendered to you my Spirit.

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:23.020
Lift me higher and higher. Higher and higher,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:29.234
away from all the things that were not the Spirit.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:37.501
Make me complete Spirit, full Spirit.”

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.721
Forget all that was there.

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:51.367
That elevation, that ascent

00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:02.300
becomes a fast, quick trip, a ‘very’ fast ascent.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:08.187
Just you can do it if you try at this moment

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:15.467
and every moment to give up all that was not the Spirit.

00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:20.687
Anything that goes against the Spirit must be given up.

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:25.120
And that is what is the pure desire,

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.254
that’s what it is the Kundalini, is the Virgin.

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:36.601
Is to be absolutely one with the
Spirit. All the rest has ‘no’ meaning,

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:43.667
has no value.

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:51.407
This ascent- whatever may be your position,

00:02:51.487 --> 00:02:55.487
to whomsoever you may be married, wherever you are working,

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:59.220
whatever is your situation, whatever may be your country,

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.534
you ‘are’ the Spirit.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.367
And if you are raised aloft,

00:03:06.767 --> 00:03:18.953
you will dwell in the beautiful kingdom
of God, where all ugliness drops out.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:27.287
Like when the lotus opens out, all the mud drops out, completely.

00:03:27.367 --> 00:03:36.987
In the same way, let my children become
the fragrant, beautiful offerings of Sadashiva.

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:39.601
May God bless you.